{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/kayan-phase-2-imkan-properties-ghadeer-al-tayr","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":597,"crm_id":"287","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Kayan Phase 2","slug":"kayan-phase-2-imkan-properties-ghadeer-al-tayr","display_address":"Ghadeer Al Tayr","building_type":["villa"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Imkan Properties","price":5594777,"display_price":"5.5M","lattitude":24.8538407,"longitude":54.8001141,"min_bedrooms":4,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Kayan 2 - the second phase of a luxury project from developer Imkan, part of Al Jurf Gardens in Abu Dhabi. It comprises an exclusive collection of <strong>4-5 bedroom villas</strong> in classic (Rihal) or contemporary (Rawya) styles. The design of the modern villas is dominated by smooth geometric lines and sharp angles, while the classic villas use traditional Arabian style - cosy courtyards and decorated facade with openwork lattices.</p><p>Residents will have access to such amenities as a 700 metre long private beach, a nearly 4.5 km long artificial canal, a marina, sports and playgrounds, and landscaped recreational areas with jogging and walking paths. There is also a medical centre, kindergartens, schools, shops and other social infrastructure facilities on the territory.</p><p>Due to its convenient location, residents will be able to quickly reach various entertainment venues in the city. Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall can be reached in 35 minutes, Yas Mall, Ferrari World Abu Dhabi theme park and Abu Dhabi International Airport are 40 minutes away, while Abu Dhabi Centre is approximately 50 minutes away.</p><p>Each Kayan 2 villa has a thoughtfully designed layout including a maid's bedroom with en-suite bathroom, storage and laundry facilities. Each residence has a balcony or terrace, private pools in the courtyard and panoramic windows offering stunning views of the Arabian Gulf.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/287/images/2023/12/14/LTM1oWyHlDJ0RiK38QSQ6fbcPSJpYiI66fuhkdWs.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/14/LTM1oWyHlDJ0RiK38QSQ6fbcPSJpYiI66fuhkdWs.jpg","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/287/images/2023/12/14/5gFSbam0Rgd2psft2iJ9i6jknXqBHnvX2AtSk73R.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/12/14/5gFSbam0Rgd2psft2iJ9i6jknXqBHnvX2AtSk73R.jpg","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/287/images/2023/06/25/nGQT16Rx8qWoQnjjOe48kQcfEYuwIrLlxhtgY0SX.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2023/06/25/nGQT16Rx8qWoQnjjOe48kQcfEYuwIrLlxhtgY0SX.jpg","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2826,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/08/22/2d1U4vXOAKbuRPVlIgefV1AusPYPUsPoael4CRgU.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1066,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1800,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"4 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1801,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 Bedroom Villa","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"30/70","payment_plans":[{"id":5424,"title":"10%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":5425,"title":"5%","description":"April 2024"},{"id":5426,"title":"5%","description":"July 2024"},{"id":5427,"title":"5%","description":"January 2025"},{"id":5428,"title":"5%","description":"June 2025"},{"id":5429,"title":"70%","description":"On Completion"}],"community":"","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id